0..60 Comment "//! `ring` represents a cyclic structure with arena indexes."
61..64 Comment "//!"
65..137 Comment "//! A node does not store its address. The structure can move or copy. A"
138..207 Comment "//! program hides heap symmetries when it does not observe locations."
208..211 Comment "//!"
212..289 Comment "//! `node` follows indexes. The loop uses `Partial` and reads four links. The"
290..313 Comment "//! source runs to `1`."
314..317 Comment "//!"
318..345 Comment "//! - see: #1183 — `ring`"
346..373 Comment "//! - see: #1481 — `ring`"
